WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:01.670
- It's Halloween in a few days.

00:00:01.670 --> 00:00:03.094
- Yes.

00:00:03.094 --> 00:00:04.180
- So, did your kids
like to trick or treat?

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.860
Did you like taking 'em?

00:00:05.860 --> 00:00:07.000
I love taking mine.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:08.450
- To be honest.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.170
Yes, but to be honest,

00:00:10.170 --> 00:00:12.720
Halloween is not a big

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:16.650
holiday for me or my wife.

00:00:16.650 --> 00:00:18.020
- Okay.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:20.020
- We, we never,

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.760
we- you know, a day that
celebrates everything

00:00:22.760 --> 00:00:23.940
that you would not want

00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:25.660
to see in a nightmare is,

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.810
is, you know, I never quite got it.

00:00:27.810 --> 00:00:31.440
And so we never went to
any Halloween parties.

00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:33.070
We never, we never,

00:00:33.070 --> 00:00:37.190
you know, put on costumes
to go to a Halloween party.

00:00:37.190 --> 00:00:38.570
- Y'all never even went to mine.

00:00:38.570 --> 00:00:40.080
- I-, what was that?

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:42.730
- You never went to mine.
I love Halloween parties.

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:45.151
- Well I make a living
putting on costumes.

00:00:45.151 --> 00:00:45.984
( Kelly Clarkson laughing)

00:00:45.984 --> 00:00:46.817
(audience laughing)

00:00:46.817 --> 00:00:48.320
The last thing I want
to do in my spare time,

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:49.880
is really put on a costume.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:53.680
But when I had kids,
that all kind of changed,

00:00:53.680 --> 00:00:55.899
cause you get the same
kind of excitement that,

00:00:55.899 --> 00:00:56.732
- Yes.

00:00:56.732 --> 00:00:57.782
- you actually had for Halloween,

00:00:57.782 --> 00:00:58.615
- Oh My Gosh.

00:00:58.615 --> 00:01:00.345
- when you're a kid. Oh.

00:01:00.345 --> 00:01:01.640
- They're so cute and little.

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:02.988
- Oh my!

00:01:02.988 --> 00:01:03.821
(Kenny Clarkson giggling)

00:01:03.821 --> 00:01:05.293
Well, when Daniel was,

00:01:06.360 --> 00:01:08.860
Daniel known as Dan Levy

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:10.740
to the rest of the world,

00:01:10.740 --> 00:01:13.350
but when Daniel was maybe three,

00:01:13.350 --> 00:01:16.330
we, we, he went on his first Halloween.

00:01:16.330 --> 00:01:17.163
- Yeah.

00:01:17.163 --> 00:01:21.990
- And my wife made him the
best Halloween costume.

00:01:21.990 --> 00:01:25.100
He was a chef and it was very simple,

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.680
but we put a white apron on him

00:01:28.680 --> 00:01:33.680
that he tied and she
made a great chef's hat.

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:35.050
- What? She made it? Okay.

00:01:35.050 --> 00:01:36.070
- She, ya, she made it,

00:01:36.070 --> 00:01:38.810
she made the band and the
little puffy thing on top

00:01:38.810 --> 00:01:41.113
and it kind of sat on his head

00:01:41.113 --> 00:01:41.946
( Kenny Clarkson giggling)

00:01:41.946 --> 00:01:43.173
and I drew a little,

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:44.903
- Oh he was a French

00:01:44.903 --> 00:01:46.580
- mustache. Right.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:49.020
And he, and he went out

00:01:49.020 --> 00:01:52.050
with a- holding a wooden spoon.

00:01:52.050 --> 00:01:56.040
And he went out as, Chef Pierre.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:01:56.897
- Chef Piel.

00:01:56.897 --> 00:01:58.710
- Yes, the cutest little thing.

00:01:58.710 --> 00:01:59.910
- I love it.

00:01:59.910 --> 00:02:01.470
- And, and my daughter's first costume

00:02:01.470 --> 00:02:04.560
was, was a kind of a princess costume

00:02:04.560 --> 00:02:05.780
that we, we bought.

00:02:05.780 --> 00:02:09.070
We didn't make it, but she put it on.

00:02:09.070 --> 00:02:12.840
She had the tiara, she
had the sparkly wand.

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.460
- Ya, did she light up?

00:02:14.460 --> 00:02:15.563
- She lit up.

00:02:15.563 --> 00:02:16.396
- Aww.

00:02:16.396 --> 00:02:17.746
- You couldn't get the grin off her face.

00:02:17.746 --> 00:02:18.795
- I love that, that-

00:02:18.795 --> 00:02:19.628
- You couldn't get the grin off her.

00:02:19.628 --> 00:02:21.150
- my daughter, the first
one was princess as well.

00:02:21.150 --> 00:02:22.930
She felt so beautiful.

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:25.490
- Because she actually felt
like she was a princess.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:27.231
- Yes, and you couldn't
convince mine otherwise either.

00:02:27.231 --> 00:02:28.064
- Yeah.

00:02:28.064 --> 00:02:29.370
- Yes. I love that.

